        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Abu Simbel</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 1264 BCE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Made by</span><span class="info-stat-val"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ramesses-ii">Ramesses II</a> of the 19th Dynasty, who built the Great Temple for himself and the gods <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/amun">Amun</a>, Ra-Horakhty and Ptah, and the Small Temple for his chief wife <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nefertari">Nefertari</a> and the goddess <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hathor">Hathor</a></span></div>
